ut 20,000","chinese":"聚集的人群增加到了大约2万人"}]},{"id":"swell:o:40804b9981c3","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"膨胀","glossesEn":["expand"],"contexts":["object","wood","balloon","tyre"]},{"id":"swell:o:babe271f69bb","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"上涨","glossesEn":["rise"],"contexts":["river"]},{"id":"swell:o:7c42c73bfdc7","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"鼓起","glossesEn":["curve out"],"examples":[{"english":"the sails swelled in the wind","chinese":"船帆在风中鼓起"}]},{"id":"swell:o:f31dd7bc1632","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"涌起","glossesEn":["well up"],"contexts":["emotion"],"examples":[{"english":"pride swelled in her heart as she watched her daughter","chinese":"她看着女儿，心中涌起一阵骄傲"}]},{"id":"swell:o:eb8fda918070","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"充满","glossesEn":["be affected by emotion"],"contexts":["person","heart"],"examples":[{"english":"she felt herself swell with indignation","chinese":"她感到义愤填膺"}]},{"id":"swell:o:080b6341c282","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"增强","glossesEn":["grow louder"],"examples":[{"english":"cheers swelled through the hall","chinese":"欢呼声响彻了大厅"}]},{"id":"swell:o:dc18c655af7d","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"增加","glossesEn":["increase in number or size"],"examples":[{"english":"to swell the ranks of sth","chinese":"增加某物的数量"}]},{"id":"swell:o:43a491d8a46c","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"使…上涨","glossesEn":["cause to rise"],"contexts":["rain","flood water","river"]},{"id":"swell:o:4d5ac3cf246d","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"使鼓起","glossesEn":["cause to curve out"],"examples":[{"english":"the wind began to swell the sails","chinese":"风把船帆吹得鼓了起来"}]},{"id":"swell:o:e0eb4f14b167","label":"n.","definitionZh":"涌动","glossesEn":["movement of sea"],"examples":[{"english":"the gentle/heavy swell of the sea","chinese":"大海舒缓/巨大的浪涌"}]},{"id":"swell:o:c4f4f85e3ed5","label":"n.","definitionZh":"隆起","glossesEn":["bulge"],"examples":[{"english":"the firm swell of her breasts","chinese":"她挺拔的双乳"}]},{"id":"swell:o:2fd4e7aee1f7","label":"n.","definitionZh":"增长","glossesEn":["increase","in amount of